best descriptions we have actually of an Inca religious festival. They bring all the effigies out from the temples at daybreak. The lords of Cusco wore rich silver cloaks and tunics with shining circlets of fine gold on their heads. They formed up in a procession and waited in deep silence for the sun to rise. And as the sun began to rise, they began to chant in splendid harmony. And as it continued to rise, they chanted higher. And all day they chant, Manco is kind of leading them. And then we're told as the sun began to sink,
关于印加宗教节日最好的描述之一。他们在黎明时分把所有的雕像从神庙里拿出来。库斯科的领主们穿着华丽的银色斗篷和束腰外衣，头上戴着闪亮的纯金圆环。他们排成队列，在深沉的寂静中等待太阳升起。当太阳开始升起时，他们开始以宏伟的和谐节奏吟唱。随着太阳继续升起，他们的吟唱声越来越高。他们整天都在吟唱，曼科在某种程度上领导着他们。然后我们被告知，当太阳开始下沉时，

14
